  id: 5
  correctSentenceData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fd3ff10ed072f4e95444e686494f71, type: 2}
  dialogChitChat:
  - Greetings dear friend!
  - I welcome you to the only coffee shop in this park!
  - "Well\u2026 what remains of it."
  - "I would love to offer you a good cup of coffee, but I can\u2019t possibly reopen
    the shop in this state."
  - As you can see, the storm that hit us in the last few days caused big damages.
  - "I\u2019m trying my best to clean up the area, but doing it with bare hands is
    not ideal."
  - There must be some kind of tool for situations like these.
  - But the only tools I know are the coffee grinder and the moka pot.
  - "I would ask for help to the Gardener but\u2026"
  - "Let\u2019s just say that we are not exactly on good terms."
  - "Well, since you are here\u2026"
  - Would it be too much to ask you to tell the Gardener that you want to clean this
    mess?
  - I know it's not your concearn...
  - But if I were to ask him myself, he would probably refuse.
  - "When it\u2019s done, I promise you will have the best coffee of your life!"
  - On the house, of course.
  - Thank you so much!
  timeLimitInSeconds: 60
  dialogPuzzleSolved:
  - What? After all this time?
  - "Listen, I didn\u2019t want to break his shovel!"
  - "For some reason I thought that using the shovel to smash the coffee beans was
    a good idea\u2026"
  - "It broke after a couple of strikes\u2026"
  - My coffee grinder was broken!
  - What else could I have done?
  - "\u2026"
  - "Anyway\u2026"
  - I should probably apologize.
  - "\u2026"
  - Could you do it for me?
  - "I\u2019m really busy right now."
  - Someone must turn this big table back up.
  dialogResponseFalse: Sorry, could you repeat that?
  dialogTimeRunOut: Hello? Is everything alright?
  dialogPuzzlePrompt: Have you talked to the Gardener yet?
  isPuzzleSolved: 0
